msgid "You can display your shortcuts by enabling the <em>Shortcuts</em> block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Blocks administration page</a>. Certain administrative modules also display your shortcuts; for example, the core <a href=\":toolbar-help\">Toolbar module</a> provides a corresponding menu link."
